        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mary Harron, Rachel Klein\n- Films: The Notorious Bettie Page, The Moth Diaries, I Shot Andy Warhol, American Psycho\n- Roles: filmmaker, screenwriter, director\n- Topics: biographical film, horror film, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Mary Harron was born on January 12, 1953, and she is a Canadian filmmaker and screenwriter.\n- Mary Harron is best known for socially conscious independent films including I Shot Andy Warhol, American Psycho, and The Notorious Bettie Page.\n- The Notorious Bettie Page is a 2005 biographical film directed by Mary Harron.\n- Rachel Klein wrote the 2002 novel The Moth Diaries.\n- The Moth Diaries is a 2011 Irish-Canadian horror film directed by Mary Harron.\n- The 2011 film The Moth Diaries is based on Rachel Klein's 2002 novel The Moth Diaries.",
